          "ocr_text": "May 12\nS- Then Peter said to them, \"Repent, and let everyone be baptized in the name of Jesus Christ for the remission of sins and you shall receive the gift of the Holy Spirit for the promise is to you and your children and to all who are afar off, as many as the Lord our God will call.\" Acts 2:38-39\n\nO- Peter cast vision of salvation of family which gave a legacy and impact of many nations. Gospel goes generational and global.\n\nA- We must keep our focus on the next generation and also the nations.\n\nP- God help me to think globally and generationally. Every Nation in our Generation\n\nMay 13\nS- Then Peter said \"Silver \u0026 Gold have I none; but such as I have give I thee. In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth rise up and walk.\" Acts 3:6\n\nO- When thinking of the power of the resurrection and fellowship of his suffering, it seems much more time was spent experiencing his power. There was the \"Hour of Darkness\" where satan was given authority to kill Jesus, but He rose 3 days later.\n\nA- I should expect to suffer and endure trials but I should expect much greater power to be demonstrated in and through my life.\n\nP- Lord, thank you for your power and willingness to perform miracles in my life.",
