          "journal_date": "2025-05-08",
          "ocr_text": "May 8\nS- Then Peter said silver and gold I do not have but what I do have I give you. In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, rise up and walk. Acts 3:6\nO- Peter was different after the resurrection. Confident. Fearless. Bold. Powerful. And was crucified upside down. Didn't want to die like Jesus.\nA- I'm so far from being counted worthy. I have a hard time soaping.\nP- God help me to be more like Jesus. Help me not to be distracted by worthless things. Resurrection is real and will happen for all those who die, choose to die like Christ.\n\nMay 9\nS- Nor was there anyone among them who lacked. For all who were possessors of lands, or houses sold them and brought the proceeds of the things that were sold and laid them at the apostles feet and they distributed to each as anyone had need. Acts 4:34,35\nO- No record of apostles buying jets, boats, horses million dollar homes. No payment for healing.\nA- Money given to the church was given to the poor.\nP- God help our church to be like the church of Acts.\n\nMay 10\nS- Then Joses who was also named Barnabas by the apostles which is translated son of encouragement a Levite of the county of Cyprus having land sold it and brought the money and laid it at the apostles feet. Acts 4:37\nO- There was a generosity and authority in the early church because of the indwelling and infilling of the Holy Spirit.\nA- I want to walk in more power, authority and generosity.\nP- God help me to be generous with every thing I have.\n\nMay 11\nS- Therefore let all of Israel know assuredly that God made Jesus whom you crucified both Lord and Christ. Acts 2:36\nO- Peter pointed out their sin. Pointed of Jesus and lord ship. Pointed out their opportunity of salvation.\nA- I need to be reminded of my sin. How did sin hurt Jesus. Jesus invitation for me to be forgiven rested.\nP- God please help me to walk in gratitude to you for the forgiveness of my sin and your love for me to pay for it through your sacrifice.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
