        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:54:04.828533+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "1e9e396a-b92f-499a-8d98-ca3f25fd99ee",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-24",
          "ocr_text": "May 24\n\nS- And this gospel of the kingdom shall be preached in all the world as a witness to all the nations and then the end will come. Matt 24:14\n\nO- The gospel going to every nation will be the result of tribulation and persecution. Power and persecution has limits. It cannot stop truth. Truth will beat all power and all lies. Truth beat Rome. Truth beat Stalin. Truth beat Mao. Truth beat Hitler. TRUTH BEAT—\n\nA- Death cannot silence truth. It only amplifies it's voice.\n\nP- God help me to see the power of truth.\n\nMay 24\n\nS- For then there will be great tribulation such as has not been since the beginning of the world until this time no, nor ever shall be. Matt 24:21\n\nO- The greatest victory will be preceded by the greatest suffering. Seed time harvest Day night Summer winter shall not cease. The greatest the darkness the brightest the dawn.\n\nA- As we live in the time of the greatest opportunity, we also live in a time of the greatest coming suffering. Being able to let go of wealth may be needed to not suffer.\n\nP- Lord help me to live every day as if my faith is being tested and tried by the anti christ.\n\nMay 28\n\nS- Wheresoever the carcass is there the eagles shall be gathered together. Matt 24:28\n\nO- The carcass is the place where dead bodies are being taken and eagles and birds gather. They aren't being taken out of the world but killed in the world.\n\nA- One will be taken and one left. The one taken is taken to a place of judgment the one left is left to inherit the earth. These people ave side by side, living as the same on the outside but different inside.\n\nP- God help me to serve you and live for you and no one else.\n\nMay 31\n\nS- And He will send His angels with a great sound of a trumpet and they will gather together His elect from the four winds from one end of heaven to the other. Matt 24:31\n\nO- The trumpet gathers God's people around the world. It announced that Jesus is here for the bride and also that He is here to fight.\n\nA- The trumpet is a sound to gather and to fight. It is one noise but heard differently is you are the bride or an enemy.\n\nP- God work in my heart to be one who looks forward to the sound of the trumpet",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212833266.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212833266.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Matthew 24:14, Matthew 24:21, Matthew 24:28, Matthew 24:31",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:54:04.802+00:00",
