        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:54:42.789863+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "52e3feb8-d0d1-429e-a492-265994e812e2",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-04",
          "ocr_text": "June 4\n\nS- In the day when God will judge the secrets of men by Jesus Christ according to my gospel. Rom 2:16\n\nO- There is nothing hidden that will not come to light. I need to live in the light as He is in the light and the blood of Jesus will cleanse me of sin\n\nA- I cannot hide my sin. Those that hide sin will not prosper. But He Lord causefulness and forsakes it will find mercy.\n\nP- God, I do love you and want to serve you with my whole heart. I fail you so much and want to be faithful to you in all I do and say.\n\nJune 10\n\nS- But he is a jew who is one inwardly and circumcision is that of the heart, in the Spirit, not in the letter whose praise is not from men but from God. Rom 2:29\n\nO- God looks at how I'm living. I need a fear of God that will make me a wise man, but understand the love of God that will work me to be a faithful steward.\n\nA- I must meditate on the Fear of God so I live in a way that my oil is constantly filled. Oil will allow me to live anointed and sanctified and at rest.\n\nP- God help me to live in communion with your spirit that leads to rest and sanctification.\n\nJune 11\n\nS- Do not deprive one another except with consent for a time that you may give yourselves to fasting and prayer and come together again so that Satan does not tempt you because of your lack of self control. 1 Cor 7:5\n\nO- Body deprive. Fast \u0026 Pray. Helps strengthen self control to fast \u0026 pray. Keeps Satans temptations at bay.\n\nA- We should be giving ourselves to each other or giving ourselves to Christ by fasting \u0026 praying to not fall into sin.\n\nP- God help me to be faithful to you and to the spouse you have given to me.\n\nJune 12\n\nS- Jesus is born, Satan attacks through murdering babies. John prepares the way. Jesus prepares himself. Jesus goes through wilderness and overcomes. He builds a team. Starts ministry with healings signs and miracles. Matt 1-4\n\nO- Satan starts early. He tries to stop life before it starts but God divinely protect. God protects and prepares the way. Provides followers for Jesus. Jesus was faithful all the time He was revealed.\n\nA- Jesus chose a team before he started his ministry. He isolated himself to fight the devil. Then moved with miracles, separation, sacrifice, supernatural.\n\nP- God help me to separate and sanctify myself for your purposes.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212869475.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212869475.jpeg"
