          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:55:34.843578+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "536af845-3b81-4f82-b347-0319d55780ff",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-17",
          "ocr_text": "June 17\nS - Jesus SENT disciples with authority. He sent them to a people. Work among them. Get paid. Be worthy of your pay. Be someone of value to them. Share gospel. Move on to person of peace. You'll be persecuted. Represent Him. Expect rejection. Matt 10\n\nO - We are called to reach the people we live among. We should create value to the people we are reaching.\n\nA - God has already sent us by being in the marketplace. We need to minister in our marketplace.\n\nP - God help me to serve w/ power in the marketplace you sent me to\n\nJune 18\nS - Jesus asked if He is sent by God and He validates ministry through signs \u0026 wonders, and also the persecution of His followers by the world. Matt 11\n\nO - Signs \u0026 wonders are shown by those who are sent by God. When they pray God will answer their prayers, they will also caller persecution\n\nA - I need to rely on Jesus for my authority. He will send me and give me a team and perform miracles. I need to record these miracles.\n\nP - God, thank you for answering prayers and showing yourself strong in and through my life.\n\nJune 19\nS - Father an unclean spirit goes out of a man he goes through the day, places see try and finds none. Then he says I will return from my home from which I came. And when he comes he finds it empty, swept and put in order. They he goes and takes with him 7 other spirits more wicked than him and they enter \u0026 dwell where and the last state of the man is worse than the first. So shall it be of this wicked generation. Matt 12:43\n\nO - Wickedness loves a vacuum. It gets filled with evil.\n\nA - I must fill my calendar and life with Good things everyday.\n\nP - God help me to be faithful with my time \u0026 heart.\n\nJune 20\nS - Parables of sowing and seed, wheat and tares, mustard seed, leaven, hidden treasure, Pearl of great price, Peanut Matt 13\n\nO - He called Ps 78 that speaks God speaking in parable it reveal his purposes at the end of time. We can know all the secrets of the ages by reading and understanding His parables.\n\nA - I want to have good soil, be wheat not a tare, give up all for the kingdom of God waiting and gnashing of teeth is promised to the wicked.\n\nP - God, please help me to focus and take your word and your kingdom above all things.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212922835.jpeg",
