        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:46:24.410548+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "e7eb5e7c-f55e-4be6-a825-c0626884db35",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-27",
          "ocr_text": "O- Nehemiah respected himself and his time because of what he was giving his time to.\nA- I will not be distracted if I value the work and time I am doing.\nP- God, help me to see the great things in doing for others and for you.\n\nJan 25\nS- Then I perceived that God had not sent him at all but that he pronounced this prophecy against me because Tobiah and Sanballat had hired him.\nO- Nehemiah saw that fear was the tactic to get him to sin and used that to discern the messenger was not from the Lord.\nA- Wherever someone tries to motivate through fear, I should discern it is not from God.\nP- God thank you for discernment. Help me to do what is right before you.\n\nJan 26\nS- So the wall was finished on the twenty fifth day of Elul, in fifty two days Neh 7:27\nO- She speed that Nehemiah worked was incredible. Less than 2 months the entire well was constructed!\nA- Favor from God and authority. Secure resources, know vision, division of labor, anticipate obstacles. Problem solve, be focused, mayorlead.\nP- God help me to build like Nehemiah.\n\nJan 27\nS- Altogether the whole assembly was 42,360 besides their male and female servants of whom there were 7,337 and 245 mules, 245 mules 435 camels, 6,720 donkeys, 1000 gold drachmas from gov. 50 basin. 530 priestly garments. 10,000 gold drachmas from Gathas house, 2200. silver drachmas, 76 priestly garments.\nO- Nehemiah started with permission/favor/resource from God and from the king. He had a clear vision of what he wanted to build, why he wanted to build it, what he needed to build it and gathered the resources to build it. Then he shared the vision and the Who gathered. He started with a burden, then permission, then provision, celebration urgency/momentum. Then called the people and had a list. He saw an inhabited city, started a...\nA- I need to know who will give permission, how much it costs, who will fund it and who it will serve and why its important. Problem/solution.\nP- God please give me wisdom in seeing Mali Village become a reality to serve our community.\n\nHEAVEN\nHEAVEN OVEBLIH HLBINE NO\nHEAVEN HLBINE NO",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212371915.jpeg",
