          "journal_date": "2025-06-13",
          "ocr_text": "June 13\nS - Jesus taught the kingdom. Calls them salt \u0026 light. Practices the law. Speaks of heart vs behavior. Matt 5 Anger. Lust. Mourning. Oaths. Serving. Love enemies.\nO - Jesus taught on the inside us outside. What God sees us what man sees. Loving enemies.\nA - Living for the kingdom will set me apart from those living for this earth. Living for God will set me against those living for man.\nP - God let me live my life consistently for you without caring about the appearance before man. Help me to love those you called me to love. God calls me to be like God. Everything points to God.\n\nJune 14\nS - Live for God and not men. Pray the Lord's Prayer. Fasting/Giving/Attention/Worry \u0026 Fear - Give all these things to God. Seek first his kingdom and all things will be given to you. Matt 6:34\nO - Everything Jesus talked about focused on the inside and relationship with God. Motives matter more than motion. Why we do something is more important than what we do.\nA - Jesus taught of a different way to live. He modeled it when performed miracles to validate his words.\nP - God help me to focus on the things of the kingdom vs man.\n\nJune 15\nS - Cast goes on others and yourself. Focus on myself. Ask \u0026 keep asking. Know others by their fruit. Not everyone will make heaven. Hear \u0026 Do = someone who will stand it out. Authority vs Entertainment. Matt 7.\nO - Jesus' messages were eyes that had authority. He spoke as someone who represented a different kingdom with different values and different rules. And He lived it.\nA - I must focus my life around living kingdom values and expecting miracles in my life.\nP - God help me to depend on you and to hear and do your word in my life.\n\nJune 16\nS - Jesus demonstrated authority over sickness Satan, sabbath, nature, sinners, sleeping/deaf, speaking/seeing + Matt 8, 9 \u0026 8 SENDING out 10\nO - Jesus demonstrated his authority over everything then He sends his disciples out. If I am sent by Jesus then He will give me authority.\nA - My \"job\" is to know Christ and be obedient to Him. In the right time He will send and empower me to expand His kingdom with signs \u0026 wonders.\nP - God help me to be separated and sanctified. Help me to surrender to your spirit more than anything",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212936535.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212936535.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Matthew 5, Matthew 6:34, Matthew 7, Matthew 8-9",
