        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:56:00.59113+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "c55bbaae-b274-40b2-80dc-174a133859c7",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-03",
          "ocr_text": "July 3\nS- commanded the children of Israel that they bring to you pure oil of pressed olives for the light to make the lamps burn continuously. Outside the veil of the testimony of meeting Aaron shall be in charge of it from evening until morning before the Lord constantly. It shall be a statute forever in your generations leo 24: 2-3\n\nO- Interesting that oil was required.\n\nA- Wise virgins had oil in their lamps. I need pure oil in mine.\n\nP- God help me to value and treasure the oil and anointing of your spirit on my life more than any thing else.\n\n\nJuly 4,\nS- And all the title of the land whether of the seed of the lab or the fruit of the tree is the Lord. It is holy to the Lord. Numbers 27:30\n\nO- 10% of anything we make belongs to God. As we honor God by giving him what is His, He will abundantly bless us\n\nA- I will title and be believe God will restate the deceiver for my sake.\n\nP- God thank you for blessing my life and thank you that although the enemy stole 5 million from me that you will restore to me 5x \u0026 what was stolen. Thank you for- 25 million that will flow back into my hands.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212951350.jpeg",
