        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:04.080098+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "3d0ac206-1e25-4350-a29a-02dcd0971038",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-02",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 2\nS- Here we are servants today. And the land that you gave to our fathers, to eat its fruit and its bounty. Here we are servants in it. Neh 9:36\nO- They recognized they were servants and didn't like it. Strange they didn't see they were servants to King Solomon\nA- Solomon took israel from being free to being in bondage. No human was called to be king. Only God.\nP- Lord help me to only desire you as king. I'm sorry and confesses that I have desired men to be my king more than I have desired you to be king of my life. I dedicate all I am to you today. Thank you for your mercy and grace.\n\nFeb 3\nS- This is a faithful saying and worthy of all acceptance that Christ Jesus came into the world to save sinners of whom I am chief. I Tim 1:15\nO- Paul being the greatest apostle admitted deep regret and failure. So did David. And Trump. All great people need Jesus. Saul tried to be great without repentance and ended up in hell.\nA- I must always be humble and repent of wrong doing. Always admit when I'm wrong but strive to be the best I can be.\nP- God please give me grace to live a life of humility, honesty and purity.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212415200.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212415200.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Nehemiah 9:36, 1 Timothy 1:15",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:04.026+00:00",
