        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:56:54.407151+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "0789d9b9-b86c-497c-98ae-9dfe2c162ad2",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-07",
          "ocr_text": "July 7\nS- And any person who is not afflicted in soul on that day shall be cut off from his people. Lev 23:29\nO- The day of atonement is a day of repentance and remembrance. It is a day to make right the wrongs and to evaluate what I must change in my life.\nA- Atonement wasn't just a day where people asked forgiveness, but when people were afflicted and humble and repentant of their sins.\nP- God help me to be humble and repentant on the days where I remember the cost you paid for me.\n\nJuly 8\nS- It shall be to you a sabbath of solemn rest and you shall afflict your souls on the ninth day of the month at evening from evening to evening you shall celebrate your sabbath. Lev 23:32\nO- Jewish holiday is the only one that I know of where they afflicted themselves and are it a place of humility\nA- I shall have rhythms of repentance and affliction where I am sorry for the wrong that I have done.\nP- God help me to be humble, reverent of you and grieve for my sin.\n\nJuly 9\nS- Then you shall cause a trumpet of jubilee to sound on the tenth day of the seventh month on the day of atonement you shall make the trumpet sound throughout all your land. Lev 25:9\nO- Interesting there is a trumpet sound that ends the feasts of trumpets and starts atonement\nA- I will look for the return of the Lord and perfection of the saints. 50 x 40yrs\nP- God thank you that you have planned out my life. Help me to put you first in all things. Amen\n\nJuly 10\nS- That in the dispensation of the fullness of time he might gather together in one all things in Christ both which are in heaven and whichsoever in earth- in Him Eph1:10\nO- It seems he will gather those in heaven and on earth at the feast of trumpets. This is also in corinthians 9. These. There will be a gathering of the righteous and the wicked. And the day of atonement will be the purging.\nA- I must live my life in such a way that I love Jesus more than anything. I want to have the hope of long with Him.\nP- God, help me to love you more than anything in the world. Help me to understand your love so I can be in love with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213003383.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213003383.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Leviticus 23:29, Leviticus 23:32, Leviticus 25:9, Ephesians 1:10",
          "source": "imported",
