        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:18.860713+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "839f6b00-53a5-4290-82ef-4e35a27126a3",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-23",
          "ocr_text": "July 23 - Gifts and Purpose\n\nS - A life aimed gave some to be apostles, some prophets, some evangelists and some pastors and teachers for the equipping of the saints for the work of the minister for the edifying of the body of Christ. Till we come to the unity of the faith and the knowledge of the son of God to a perfect man, to the measure of the stature of the fullness of Christ. Eph4:11,13\n\nO - All gifts build the body for ministry for edification of the body.\n\nA - All gifts need to be activated in our church to see it matured.\n\nP - God give me the gameplan to see all 5 gifts functioning in the church.\n\nJuly 24 - Day Steal\n\nS - Let him who stole steal no more but let him work with his hands what is good that he may have something to give to him who has need. Ep4:28\n\nO - From stealing to working to giving. God has called us out of a life style of taking into a life style of giving/generosity.\n\nA - I am at the cup of a life of crazy abundance. God is going to bless me so that I can be a blessing to others.\n\nP - God, help me to live to give. To find my purpose in Laying you, serving others and up walling\n\nJuly 25 - Communication\n\nS - Let no corrupt communication proceed out of your mouth but what is necessary edification that it may impart grace to the heavens. Ep4:29\n\nO - Words can impart grace to people who hear it. My words are used to edify, to build up.\n\nA - I will always use my words to build others up. Not to be snarky or tear down but to love.\n\nP - God, help me to be loved by you and to use my words to love others\n\nJuly 26 - Imitate Christ\n\nS - Be imitators of God as dear children. Walk in love as Christ has loved us and given himself for us an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweet smelling aroma. Ep5:1,2\n\nO - We can be like children by imitating our heavenly Father by living in the same way by sacrificing himself to God for us.\n\nA - I should look at Jesus like a child looks at their parent and imitate him by living to sacrifice to God who it on to serve others.\n\nP - God, help me to be humble and imitate you by serving others, the way you served me",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213027834.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213027834.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Ephesians 4:11,13; Ephesians 4:28; Ephesians 4:29; Ephesians 5:1,2",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:18.815+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
