        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:27.172611+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "eda2bd5a-b5e3-4257-9548-f6ee58c0d9d5",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-19",
          "ocr_text": "July 19\nS- And He came and preached peace to you who were far off and to those who were near. Through Him we both have access by one spirit to the Father. Eph2:10\nO- It is interesting that nearness for preaching I need the gospel just as much as the past person.\nA- I have access to the Father; I don't feel making use\nP- God help me to silence voices and distractions to draw near to you. Help me set aside every sin and weight to easily beset me.\n\nJuly 20\nS- That Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith that you being rooted and grounded in His may be able to comprehend with all the saints what is the width and length and depth and height- to know the love of Christ which passes knowledge that you may be filled with all fullness of God. Eph3:17,18\nO- The fullness of God in our lives comes from being rooted and grounded in His love.\nA- Rooted in love- means? Grounded in love- means?\nP- God thank you that you love me and are for me. Help me to be rooted AND GROUNDED in your love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213040208.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213040208.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Ephesians 2:10; Ephesians 3:17-18",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:27.155+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:38.440201+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "dad8cb2c-9ab3-4e5d-88fa-20eabf6916d5",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-08",
          "ocr_text": "Aug 8\nS- Being confident of this very thing that He who began a good work in you will complete it until the day of Jesus Christ. Phil 1:6\nO- Jesus is the one who starts and He is the one who completes the good work in our life. We must cooperate.\nA- I should have confidence in what God is doing and completing in my life. He has a plan that's much greater than I can comprehend.\nP- God please give me faith to surrender to your spirit and your hand moving me in my life.\n\nAug 9\nS- Only let your conduct be worthy of the gospel of Christ so that whether I came and see you or am absent, I may hear of your affairs that you stand fast in one spirit with one mind striving together for the faith of the gospel Phil1:27\nO- Living worthy of the gospel is standing in unity with other believers to love and to love others.\nA- I want to be a disciple. One who follows, fishes and follows\nP- God help me to go deeper in all my love relationships. Lord, you a believer\n\nAug 10\nS- For Christ did not send me to baptize but to preach the gospel, not with wisdom of words lest the cross of Christ should be made of no effect. I Cor 1:17\nO- Paul was focused on preaching the gospel and completely focused on that.\nA- I need to know what God has called me to do and focus on that. Good! It's enemy of best.\nP- God help me to stay focused on making disciples and being a disciple. Help me to run in my lane.\n\nAug 11\nS- And my speech and my preaching were not with persuasive words of human wisdom but in demonstration of power and of the Spirit. I Cor 2:4\nO- Paul showed the power of God more than just wisdom. The gospel includes God's power.\nA- We need to share the power of God through healings, conversions, miracles, answers to prayer.\nP- God help me to live a life of devotion and prayer that results in miracles",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213048278.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213048278.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Philippians 1:6, Philippians 1:27, 1 Corinthians 1:17, 1 Corinthians 2:4",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:38.421+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:22.368541+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "adc362db-4c75-407f-b3e3-c8bbc579b297",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-30",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 30\n\nS- And they found written in the law which it had commanded by Moses that the children Lord found should dwell in booths during the Feast of the Seventh month. Neh 8:14\n\nO- They had finished the wall but returned to living in tents.\n\nA- Fight to keep my perspective on the eternal. God will dwell with us.\n\nP- God help me to see eternally.\n\nJan 31\n\nS- Day by day from the first day until the last day, he read from the Book of the law of God. And the Levites kept the seventh feasts. And on the 8th day there was a sacred day according to the prescribed manner. Neh 8:18.\n\nO- They kept the Feast of Tabernacles.\n\nA- Jesus will abide with us.\n\nP- Jesus help me to keep my eyes on the prize.\n\nFeb 1\n\nS- And they stood up in their place and read from the Book of the law of the Lord their God for 1/4 of the day and for another 1/4 of the day they confessed and worshiped the Lord their God. Neh 9:3\n\nO- For 16 hrs they read the Bible, worshiped and confessed sins.\n\nA- We shall spend more time confessing sins to God and each other.\n\nP- Father I'm sorry that I became more passionate about other things than you. Please help me to love you more. Amen.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212434887.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212434887.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Nehemiah 8:14, Nehemiah 8:18, Nehemiah 9:3",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:22.305+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:53.161856+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "6bfa8459-55ef-4476-a49b-a15bd1763d87",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-04",
          "ocr_text": "Aug 4\nS- You were once in darkness but now YOU ARE light in the Lord. Walk as children of light. Eph 5:8\nO- Paul says it was IN darkness but now I AM light in the Lord. I dont just walk IN light but I AM light in Him\nA- God help me to see who I AM in you \u0026 I need to see my identity of who you say that I AM.\nP- God help me to know who I AM in you. That I have a new identity, I am a child of the light. I AM light in you.\n\nAug 5\nS- According to the eternal purpose which he accomplished in christ Jesus our Lord. In whom we have boldness and access with confidence through faith in Him Ep3:11\nO- There is a purpose that transcends time. This is accomplished through Christ. So This eternal purpose gives us confidence \u0026 boldness THROUGH FAITH IN HIM.\nA- My confidence \u0026 boldness comes through faith in Christ and my eternal purpose in Him. If I'm insecure, doubting, have fearful it is probably because I have faith in something else\nP- God help me to transfer the trust I have in myself, money or anything else to YOU. Give me eyes to see my eternal purpose in you.\n\nAug 6\nS- knowing that whatever good anyone does, he will receive the same from the Lord whether the slave or free. Eph 6:8\nO- Paul is trying to get people focused on an eternal destination of equality and to live for the Lord and not for others.\nA- We should look at the eternal destination of judgement in all decisions we make.\nP- God help me to keep my heart and mind on standing in front of you on judgement day\n\nAug 7\nS- Praying always with all prayer and supplication in the spirit being watchful to this end with all perseverance and supplication for all the saints. Ep 6:18\nO- Paul urges others to pray and intercede for the saints of God. We must see the power and the result of a Prayerful life.\nA- I need to pray more for my family, for my staff, leadership and church\nP- God, please forgive me for not praying enough. Please help me to be more disciplined in my prayer life for others and their walk with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213059591.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213059591.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Ephesians 5:8, Ephesians 3:11, Ephesians 6:8, Ephesians 6:18",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:57:53.141+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:58:04.250266+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "5b993374-d191-407a-a219-c963fe2a5cd0",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-31",
          "ocr_text": "July 31\nS- See then that you walk circumspectly, not as fools but as wise, redeeming the time because the days are evil. Therefore do not be unwise but understand what the will of the Lord is. Eph 5:15-17\nO- We can be wise and know what God's will is. We can redeem time. We can make up for lost time.\nA- I need to give God the first part of my day and spend every min doing what He wants us to do.\nP- God help me to give priority to your presence and your Word.\n\nAug 1\nS- Be filled with the Spirit speaking to one another in psalms and hymns \u0026 spiritual songs, singing and making melody in your heart to the Lord. Giving thanks, submitting... Eph 5:18-21\nO- Being filled with Spirit seems to be tied to worshipping through the day.\nA- I should listen to worship music more often, sing it in my life and be guided by it.\nP- God help me to live a lifestyle of surrender \u0026 worship.\n\nAug 2\nS- And take the helmet of salvation and the sword of the Spirit which is the Word of God. Eph 6:17\nO- God can keep my mind sharp through his word.\nA- I need to give priority to the Word in my life. It will be my sword and a protection to my life.\nP- God please help me to stand!!\n\nAug 3\nS- For you know this, that no fornicator, unclean person nor covetous man, who is an idolater has ANY inheritance in the kingdom of Christ and God. Eph 5:5\nO- Paul balances grace with fear of God. There is a consequence for idol worship. It makes us slaves to sin. It makes me disgusted from the inheritance that God has for me.\nA- As Jacob took the blessing \u0026 inheritance from Esau, the enemy can steal very inheritance. I give it away when I am overcome with the desires of my flesh. Esau gave it away for a bowl of soup.\nP- God forgive me for times I give into my flesh. It is idolatry and a choice to listen to my flesh instead of the Spirit.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213074270.jpeg",
