        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:58:15.437645+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "8ab7096e-7b68-4e12-a497-d2b43828d04b",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-20",
          "ocr_text": "Aug 20\nS- Therefore lay aside all filthiness and overflow of wickedness and receive with meekness the implanted word which is able to save your souls. James 1:21\nO- The power of the Word is stronger than any type of sin or corruption.\nA- Solution to sin is the Spirit and the word of God.\nP- God thank you for the Sword of the Spirit which is the Word of God.\n\nAug 21\nS- Pure and undefiled religion before God and the Father is this to visit orphans and widows in their trouble and to keep oneself unspotted from the world. James 1:27\nO- Gods requirement is simple. To help the helpless and to keep myself unspotted from the world. The animals got spit from what they looked at I must keep my eyes focused on the right things.\nA- Catherine seems to be getting attacked on all sides. I need to keep her in prayer.\nP- God help Catherine and all the other orphans and widows safe and loved.\n\nAug 22\nS- Listen my beloved brethren has God not chosen the poor of this world to be rich in faith and heirs of the kingdom which he promised to those who love him? James 2:5\nO- The poor understand things of the kingdom that the rich do not. \u0026 They can be rich in faith and things that are unseen\nA- I should esteem Phyllis and Stanley and others with respect and honor.\nP- God help me to show love, honor and dignity to all people that you have created.\n\nAug 23\nS- And the scripture was fulfilled which says Abraham believed God and it was accounted unto him for righteousness. And he was called a friend of God. James 2:23\nO- When I act in faith it pleases God and friendship with God is possible through acting in faith.\nA- Faith who works is dead. When God tells me something action is required and a relationship with God is result. If I want a real relationship with God then I must act on what I hear.\nP- God help me to be a doer of what you tell me. Guide me into a deeper relationship with you through action.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213085483.jpeg",
