        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:36.272209+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "bdaa65ff-cc8b-4730-8934-705bdb42859b",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-13",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 13.\nS- And the Lord make you increase and abound in love to one another and to all just as we do to you. so that He may establish your hearts blameless in holiness before our God and Father at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ with all His saints.\nI Thess 3:12\n\nO- Paul wanted them to love each other so they would be established before Jesus returned.\n\nAs We should keep our expectation on the return of Christ and love one another.\n\nP- Jesus, thank you for the call you have given us to love one another, and so much so it's as you are coming back.\n\nFeb 14\nS- For if we believe that Jesus died and rose again even so God will bring with Him these who sleep in Jesus. For this we say to you by the word of the Lord that we who are alive and remain until the coming of the Lord will by no means precede those who are asleep. For the Lord Himself will descend from Heaven with a shout with the voice of an archangel and with the trumpet of God and the dead in Christ shall rise first. THEN we who are alive and remain shall be caught up together with them in the clouds to meet the Lord in the air. and thus we shall always be with the Lord.\n\nO- Paul was giving the Word of God that there would be a return of Christ, a resurrection of the dead and an ascension of saints when Christ returns.\n\nA- I want to look forward to this day. Not going to heaven.\n\nP- God, please help me to focus on the day that you will return, and will raise my body from the dead or allow us to ascend with you.\n\nFeb 15\nS- Now may God of peace Himself sanctify you completely and may your whole spirit soul and body be preserved blameless at the coming of the Lord Jesus Christ. I Thess 5:23\n\nO- Paul talked of a body that would be blameless not just a spirit and soul. God will resurect the body and give a new one.\n\nA- I will have the hope that God will redeem my body and make me like Christ.\n\nP- Lord change my expectation and hope to be resurrected and not just eternal life as a spirit.\n\nFeb 16\nS- Therefore we also pray always for you that our God would count you worthy of this calling and fulfill all the good pleasure of His goodness and the work of faith with power. II Thess 1:11\n\nO- This was said after paul talks of the massive punishment that awaits their enemies. Jesus is coming with the sword and fire.\n\nA- I want to walk w/ Christ. With the power of His resurrection and fellowship of suffering.\n\nP- God please use me to strengthen the church in Myanmar.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212444002.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212444002.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "1 Thessalonians 3:12, 1 Thessalonians 4:14-17, 1 Thessalonians 5:23, 2 Thessalonians 1:11",
          "source": "imported",
