        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:58:27.747394+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "b8efae79-b59b-49e8-9993-ee4195b5f672",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-17",
          "ocr_text": "Therefore having these promises beloved let us cleanse ourselves from all filthiness of the flesh and spirit perfecting holiness in the fear of God. II Cor 7:1\n\nO - We have great promises and we are loved. This gives me the power to overcome all my sin.\n\nA - I need to focus on the love and grace of God to overcome all of my shortcomings.\n\nP - God give me grace to follow you with all my heart soul mind and strength.\n\nAug 17\n\nS - Life will lead us into storms\nWe can do everything right → storms\nWrong → storms\nLong storm + harder to last\nExample -\nMaybe your going through a storm\nJesus was watching looking for faith\n→ We want them to do themselves\nWe stay small if we dont go through storms\nEveryone wants a miracle but doesnt want a storm\nFocus on Jesus + rise above the storm\n\nAug 18\n\nS - Let she lowly brother glory in his entertain and the rich in his humiliation, because as a flower of the field he will pass away, James 1:9-10\n\nO - There will be a flattening out of glory of man. All pour and glory belongs to the Lord. Humbled will be exalted and exalted will be humbled. We are all Gods creation\n\nA - I will treat others with dignity and respect as we are all brothers and the day will come where everyone throws their crowns down.\n\nP - God, please help me to live in a way that honors you and lifts up those who are down trodden.\n\nAug19\n\nS - For no sooner has the sun risen with a burning heat than it withers the grass its flowers fade falls and its beautiful appearance perishes. So the rich man also will fade away in his pursuits. James 1:11\n\nO - No matter how cool a business is, it will be left to someone else. But there is a reward of resurrection to those who love Jesus and serve Him\n\nA - I want to love Jesus and serve Him w/ my whole heart and to be an example of someone who obeys w a pure heart.\n\nP - Lord so many things distract from me loving you with all my heart. Help me love you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213096719.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213096719.jpeg"
          ],
