        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:58:53.093937+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "7de21c5f-a4d1-499d-80e2-255336b59aac",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-01",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 1\nS- Pay careful attention to him and obey his voice. Do not rebel against him for he will not pardon your transgression for my name is in him. Ex. 23:21\n\nO- Adam Cain Noah Penal Nehemiah Moses law\nMaturity ↓ ↓\nRules ↓ ↓ ↓ ↑ ↓ ↑ ↓\nRelationship ↓ ↓ ↓ ↓ ↑ ↓ ↑\nConsequence ↓ ↓ ↑ ↓ ↓ ↑ ↓\nWickedness ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↓ - ↓\n\nA- Seems high relationship give smaller rules and smaller consequences. But low relationship equals more rules and more consequences. His spirit will write laws on our hearts. But relationship with disobedience will result in huge consequence. According to Hebrews.\n\nP- God help me to have the ultimate law of love written on my heart.\n\nSept2\nS- Then all the tax collectors and the sinners drew near to Him to hear him. Luke 15:1\n\nO- There was a spirit/heart of love that drew sinners to Jesus. Did Jesus not display the same heart of love to the pharisees? O is it pride that drew Jesus away? We truly are all sinners. But \"sinners\" admit they know they are. I do not.\n\nA- I am the worst of sinners because I act like a saint. I need to humble myself before God and ask him to forgive me everyday.\n\nP- God please help me to love you and to be humble\n\nSept4\nO- I say to you there is more joy in heaven over one sinner who repents than over ninety-nine just persons who need no repentance. Luke 15:7\n\nO- Gods heart to see all people. Not just some that are saved is the waits everyone to come to know who He is.\n\nA- I (and I am) a child of God. I need to love the lost and have passion for those who don't know Him.\n\nP- God give me a heart for the lost. The same heart of love that's willing to die to myself. Let it begin with my wife.\n\nSept5\nS- Then a white robe was given to each of them and it was said to them that they should rest a little longer UNTIL both the number of their fellow servants AND their brethren who would be killed as they were was completed. Rev 6:11\n\nO- There is a number of martyrs that will complete the number of saints killed for their faith. Each martyr bring the return of Christ closer.\n\nA- My perspective of suffering is altered. Precious in the sight of the Lord is the death of his saints.\n\nP- God please help me to live in such a way that represents who you are.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Exodus 23:21; Luke 15:1; Luke 15:7; Revelation 6:11",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:58:53.073+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:50.771381+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "cd458b3b-9dc3-4182-a1f5-626e301baff0",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-10",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 10\nS- Let the elders who rule well be counted worthy of double honor, especially those who labor in the word and doctrine. I Tim 5:17\n\nO- How does this relate to Judges and much the lengths. He uses paid to bless what people did. Elders are paid to teach the word.\n\nA- Its okay to be paid to preach the word if the word is determined by God and not man. If the word is a life message or one that God places in my heart\n\nP- God help me to be able to be totally free of stress of finances.\n\nCouple Retreat\n1. Made in God's image (male \u0026 female) - Alignment\n2. Roles \u0026 Goals - Thinker + Feeler - HD\n3. Love Languages - Speak another language\n4. University of Selflessness\n5. Love \u0026 Respect -\n6. Solving Conflict\n   · know seasons \u0026 make rules\n   · No emotional decisions\n   · Write out argument when big\n   · Have counsel. Be under Authority.\n   · Give time for others to spend time w/ God.\n   · Don't speak when mad.\n7. Parenting\n   · Lead Right in front of children\n   · DEM Respect \u0026 honor when other parent is absent\n   · SIT in front · shepherd the heart\n   · No sleeping in bed\n   · Sleep 2 cat schedule\n\nFeb 11\nS- And to wait for his Son from heaven, whom he raised from the dead, even Jesus who delivers us from the wrath to come. I Thes 1:10\n\nO- Wait for Jesus to RETURN who is raised up. Paul was encouraging them to wait and expect Jesus to return.\n\nA- Very few expect Christ to return. They expect to die and go to be w/ Christ. I will expect him to come here.\n\nP- God thank you that Jesus will return and we will see Him on earth one day.\n\nFeb 12\nS- For what is our hope or joy or crown of rejoicing? Is it not even you in the presence of our Lord Jesus Christ at his coming? For you are our glory and joy. I Thess 2:19,20\n\nG- Paul was saying that when Christ returns, the joy of his heart would be to see those souls saved because of the gospel shared that saves from God's wrath.\n\nA- If I truly believe Jesus is returning and the gospel will save people from wrath, I should do everything I can to love people into the Kingdom.\n\nP- God, help me to prioritize souls more than anything in the world.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212457440.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212457440.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "1 Timothy 5:17, 1 Thessalonians 1:10, 1 Thessalonians 2:19-20",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T00:47:50.716+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:59:05.357589+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "739e684f-3985-49a6-98b9-2b76f35ed418",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-24",
          "ocr_text": "Aug 24\nS- Even so the tongue is a little member and boasts great things. See how great a forest a little fire kindles. James 3:5\nO- The words that people say communicates ideas that can set things ablaze.\nA- I need to be vocal about things I'm doing and get people to talk about it until tithing start to heat up\nP- God please help me to turn my faces to you and things that matter in my life instead of meditating pain.\n\nAug 29\nS- Where there is envy and self seeking, confusion and every evil thing are there. James 3:16\nO- When I'm wanting what others have and seek things for myself it leads to evil things.\nA- I need to be God focused and others focused. I need to be a part of things to give to God and to others.\nP- God please give me the grace to take eyes of myself and to give my time talent and treasure to others. I'm in a very precarious financial situation as cashflow is weak and not meeting monthly demand. This will run cannot happen fast enough.\n\nAug 30\nS- All the wisdom that if you above is first pure then peaceable, gentle, willing to yield, full of mercy and good fruits, without partiality, and without hypocrisy. Now the fruit of righteousness is sown in peace by those who make peace. James 3:17,18\nO- Jesus displayed wisdom from above. He didn't dominate. He came as a child and in peace. He calls us to follow him in the same spirit.\nA- All authority has been given to Christ. He calls me to operate in the same spirit. To have the same fruit.\nP- God help me to walk in your spirit and not the spirit of man.\n\nAug 31\nS- You will keep him in perfect peace whose mind is stayed on you because he trusts in you. Trust in the Lord forever for the Lord God is an everlasting Rock. Isaiah 26:3,4\nO- If my mind is stayed/set/fixed on Jesus I will remain in perfect peace because I will trust in God.\nA- My mind seems so fractured by so many things. I need time where I just stay focused on Jesus.\nP- God help me to be stayed on You. SET on you. Nothing matters except you in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213134353.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213134353.jpeg"
