          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-11-12",
          "ocr_text": "Nov 12\n\nS- I will not set before my eyes anything that is worthless. I hate the work of those who fall away. It shall not cling to me. Psalm 101:3\n\nO- Job made a covenant w/ his eyes. David also didn't put worthless thing before his eyes.\n\nA- I must guard my eyes from things that have no eternal value. I must put good things before my eyes.\n\nP- God please give me the grace to guard my heart with all diligence.\n\nNov 13\n\nS- If my people who are called by my name will humble themselves and pray and seek my face and turn from their wicked ways, I will hear from heaven, forgive their sins and heal their land. II Chron 7:14\n\nO- Humility → prayer → seeking face → Turn from sin. Repentance starts w/ humility z prayer. It will then lead to seeking God's face/favor/blessing, this will cause us to turn from sin.\n\nA- I must humble myself. Begin to pray. Have a disciplined prayer life. Then seek God's face. Turning from sin starts by turning to God in humility.\n\nP- God I can't do life without you. I cannot live righteously without you. I need you to show me the way of escape and to give me courage to obey.\n\nNov 19\n\nS- There by the deeds of the law no flesh will be justified in the sight by the law is the knowledge of sin. Rom 3:20\n\nO- Knowing something is sin has as power to free us from it. It is only through Jesus that I can be set free from the power of sin.\n\nA- I must fix my eyes on Christ and his love and grace for my life.\n\nP- God thank you for the love and grace you have poured out on my life in Jesus.\n\nNov 15\n\nS- For all have sinned and fallen short of the glory of God, being justified freely by His grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus. Rom 3:23 24\n\nO- Everyone has sinned and everyone can be redeemed to God through Christ.\n\nA- There is freedom and redemption in Christ Jesus and in Him alone.\n\nP- God help me to understand how to live in reciprocity to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213431314.jpeg",
