        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:59:31.44115+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "b8a54d37-11c3-4528-bae0-34ddd7de5294",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-14",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 14\nS- And the armies in heaven clothed in fine linen, white and clean followed him on white horses. Rev 19:13\nO- Those in chapter 6, the martyrs had the white robes, but now the hath white horses. This is the Revelation of Jesus and His bride. How much patience must God feel to listen to these voices and not act.\nA- If Jesus is waiting on executing judgment then I have no place to do it myself. If I want justice I must first lay my life down on this side of Heaven to ask for vengeance in the next. We must remain patient to suffer for His name to be counted worthy to as for God to avenge my blood.\nP- God help me to lay my life down and to serve others and to share the word of my testimony to others.\n\nSept 15\nS- But the cowardly, unbelieving, abominable, murderers sexually immoral, sorcerers, idolaters, and all liars shall have their part in the lake of fire which burns with fire and brimstone which is the second death. Rev 21:8\nO- There is a place for people who are not following Christ.\nA- I need to have a fear of the Lord to work out my salvation\nP- God help me to love and obey you with all my heart.\n\nSept 16\nS- Behold I am coming quickly! Blessed is he who keeps the words of the prophecy of this book. Rev 22:7\nO- Jesus' return is soon. I should do everything I can do to prepare for His return.\nA- In light of His return I should prepare for it by serving Christ and having integrity of heart and putting Christ first.\nP- I want to love you more and give my life to you more. Please increase my love for you. Gently pls.\n\nSept 17\nS- And anyone not found in the book of life was thrown into the lake of fire. Rev 20:15\nO- Being written in the lambs book of life is the most important thing anyone can do.\nA- I want to be written in the laws book of life more than anything in this world. More than treasure or any other thing. What profits a man to gain the world and lose his soul?\nP- God help me to prioritize being written in your book more than anything else in life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213160566.jpeg",
