        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:59:45.177895+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "9c2b03d0-baf5-40fd-aac9-9786c8b219f2",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-10",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 10\nS - For God so loved the world that he gave his only son that whosoever believes in him should not perish but have everlasting life. John 3:16\nO - God loves everyone. This love was made shown in the life of Jesus. God's only son. It's not just love but a promise of eternal life that was demonstrated in the event of Resurrection that the world celebrates on easter. That whoever believes would receive it.\nA - We can believe in Jesus. And live in a way that glorifies Him.\nP - God please help me to live for you in everything I do and say.\n\nSept 11\nS - When he opened the 5th seal I saw under the alter the souls of those who had been slain for the word of God and for the testimony which they held. Rev 6:9\nO - There are many people throughout history that have been killed by stacked others for sharing the truth. There is a spirit of hatred and murder.\nA - Understand that there is no rationalization of these who have embraced a murderous abusive spirit. I cannot worry about explaining away hatred. Everyone has their choice to make.\nP - God please help me to have a fear of you. Not man. Not Death. Not Sickness\n\nSept 12\nS - And they cried with a loud voice saying how long O Lord holy and true will you judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth. Rev 6:16\nO - There was a loud voice going to God asking for justice. The cry went from Father forgive them to AVENGE OUR BLOOD\nA - There is intercession asking Christ to Return to Earth to AVENGE THE BLOOD and it gets louder withe each martyr that is added to the altar.\nP - God help me to call on you for mercy and help me to be one who lays my life down for that.\n\nSept 13\nS - The a white robe was given to each of them and it was said to them that they should rest a little while longer until both the number of their fellow servants and their brethren who would be killed as they were was completed. Rev 6:11\nO - The number of martyrs needs to be completed. Just as Jesus was prophecied to die and go to lay down his life there is a number of people who are destined to lay down their life.\nA - I need to embrace the closing of what you have me. Even if I'm not at a place to lay my life down, I've experienced the blood of the lamb. I can now get better at sharing the word of my testimony. That will set me up to lay my life down.\nP - God help me to lay my life down.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg"
