        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:59:57.719093+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "804b5e5d-f384-43cc-af83-3cea08aa95d5",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-06",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 6\nS- And they cried with a loud voice saying How long O Lord holy and true until you judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth? Rev 6:10\nO- There is a cry from under the altar in heaven into the ears of God, asking for his return to earth. to execute vengeance on the wicked. This prayer is very close to the throne of God, and the volume gets louder with every martyr added. It brings us closer to His return.\nA- I will live in a way that shows I have laid my life down for the cause of Christ. It died as a martyr in America. Was counted worthy to suffer. How can I do this?\nP- God help us to live a life that's like Christ.\n\nSept 7\nS- For then there will be great tribulation such has not been seen since the beginning of this world until this time no one shall ever be. Matt 24:21\nO- The great tribulation will happen after the abomination of desolation. Days will be shortened.\nA- As Jesus, his disciples, Charlie died there will be a great tribulation where power will be given to Paddle filled w/ hatred.\nP- God please help me to love everyone like you did w/ a sacrificial love.\n\nSept 8\nS- Blessed and holy is he who has part in the first resurrection over such the second death has no power but they shall be the priest of God and Christ with Him a thousand years. Rev 20:6\nO- There is a 1st resurrection that will happen and it seems not everyone will be a part of it.\nA- It shows that these were the martyrs. Why is this not taught. Radical left are taught to kill. Radical christ followers are taught to die.\nP- God help me to die everyday to myself.\n\nSept 9\nS- And the armies in heaven clothed in fine linen white and clean followed Him on white horses. Rev 19:15\nO- There were the martyrs in Rev 6 with white Robes who were asking for Christ to return. Was this them?\nA- I should not be hasty in assuming that I am a saint that will be w/ Jesus' army. I need fear and trembling to give myself 100% to Jesus.\nP- God help us to follow you with my whole heart and life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Rev 6:10",
          "source": "imported",
