          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:02:23.502388+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "d85dbd13-ae0d-4120-a466-82eb63ea377b",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-13",
          "ocr_text": "S - But the veil of the dead did not live again until the thousand years were finished. This is the first resurrection. Blessed and Holy is he that hath part in the first resurrection. Over such the second death has no power but they shall be priests of God and of Christ and shall reign with Him 1000 yrs.\nO - There will be a select group. Those behaded for their faith/witness to Jesus, who didn't worship the beast, his image, or have his mark.\nA - There is a special priviledge to those who die for their testimony and are not subject to the world system.\nP - God, I don't need to be a part of the 1000 reign but help me to share my testimony of how you saved me.\n\nOct 13\nS - Now when the thousand years have expired, Satan will be released from his prison and will go out to deceive the nations of the earth which are in the four corners, Gog \u0026 Magog to gather them together to battle, where number is as the sand of the sea.\nO - This seems discouraging that even these far 20:7,8,9 in the 1000yr reign will have seed in the number of the sands that are deceived, gathered and destro\nA - God, help me to serve you in a way that purifies me and my legacy. If I surrender my will to you. Help me to live and love you with my whole.\nP - There is not much I can do to control heart whether or not I or my descendants are chosen by God to inhabit His kingdom. He choses the purges. He decides. And He is good. I can trust Him\n\nOct 14\nS - And anyone not found written in the Book of Life was cast into the Lake of Fire. Rev 20:15\nO - There is a book that has names in it that lived for Christ and love Christ. This book can have names deleted down in according to Rev 3:5.\nA - Is white garments or white out. Strengthen what remains. Remember, hold fast. Repent.\nP - God help me to always love you from a heart of gratitude and remembrance. You call me to remember and recall your goodness and your kindness and mercy. It is so easy to get complacent and take for granted. Forgive me and give me grace to pursue you.\n\nOct 15\nS - He who overcame shall inherit all things. And I will be his God and he shall be my son, Rev 21:7\nO - There are only two outcomes Overcoming and being overcome. It's an all or nothing wager. God is a God of extreme. Hot or Cold, Light or Darkness, Good or Evil. Heaven or Hell. Satan owns the force.\nA - There are worthy opponents in this life to overcome. Doubt. Fear. Lust. Pride. God hasn't called me to mitigate sin but to irradicate it. Through Christ. As I get closer to Him, He will push the darkness out.\nP - Jesus draw me close to you. So close that your presence causes me to overcome all enemies of evil and the flesh in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213328654.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213328654.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Revelation 20:5-7, 20:15, 3:5, 21:7",
          "source": "imported",
