          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-22",
          "ocr_text": "Intro - Ram (great employer/friend)\n- Share tips \u0026 tricks. Preacher not Marketplace guru.\n- Expectations.\n- Management \u003e Making - Compound interest\n- Understand money = Time \u0026 Energy\n  • House in 2001 150k, 900k = 6x    4x now\n    35k    45k = 1.85x\n\n- Make \u0026 ask\n- Manage\n- Mobilize\n- Multiply\n\nMatt 25 - Not how much we have\n        what we do with what we have\n  • Called to steward - time talent\n                       Treasure\n  • No comparison\n  • No judging\n  • No laziness\n  • No failure\n\nMake            Mind - Imagination\n               Mouth - Network\n                      Mentoring\n               Manage            Marketing\n      Muscle\n\nTitles - Avon\nYou need to be active in the treasury.\nYou need to know what options -\nowe $30,000, you options of what you pay.\nComplex individuals?\n\nIntentional \u0026 Engaging.\nGoals: Where do you want to be?\n       What are you willing to do?\n       Faithful \u0026 Consistent = Success.\n       Difference b/t success and failure is consistent.\n       Do what your passionate about\n       Passion = Consistence and Persistent\n       Keys of Surviving, no one can compete.\n\nFeb 22\nS - For we are His workmanship created in Christ Jesus for\n    good works which God prepared beforehand that we should\n    walk in them Eph 2:10\n\nO - All my works and walk is found in Christ and\n    no where else.\n\nA - I must trust Jesus for everything\n\nP - Lord help me to serve you first before anything\n    else in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212490226.jpeg",
