          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-24",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 24\n6- Be watchful and strengthen the things that remain that are ready to die for I have not found your works perfect before God. Remember how you have received and heard. Hold fast and repent. If you will not watch I will come upon you like a thief and you will not know what how I will come upon you. Rev 3:2,3.\n\nO- Strengthen things ready to die. Works need to be perfect before God. Watch and pray.\n\nA- I need to watch for His return and not get lazy in my passion and zeal for Jesus.\n\nP- God please help me to love you more and serve those you love.\n\nSept 25\nFinancial Education\nProv 16- Man devises his Path, God establishes his steps. God ordains steps.- Bankruptcy Tax Parkside, Abe Miracle.\n\nS- You are worthy to receive glory and honor and power for you created all things and by your will they exist and were created. Rev 4:11\n\nO- God deserves my All glory honor and power from me because He made me. treasure.\n\nA- I will give Him glory through my tithe and taking care of His House, honor by giving my time, power by giving Him my will.\n\nP- God yet thank you for giving me these talents treasure. Help me to honor you in giving it back to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213222337.jpeg",
