          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-28",
          "ocr_text": "Oct 28\n\nS- All unrighteousness is sin and there is sin not leading to death. I John 5:17\n\nO- All sin is not the same. There's sin that leads to death. What is that sin? It is sin against the body? Sexual sin? Sin against the Holy Spirit?\n\nA- I should look at sin as not the same. Some sins can lead to death. But why not pray about those things?\n\nP- God please help me to repent and give attention to my heart and to give you all of my heart.\n\nOct 29\n\nS- We know that we are of God and the whole world lies under the sway of the soul the wicked one. And we know that the Son of God has come and hee given us an understanding that we may know Him who is true and we are in Him who is true, in His Son Jesus Christ. This is the true God and eternal life. Little children, keep yourselves from idols. I John 5:19-21\n\nO- Knowing Christ is knowing the Son of God and is life. Everything else is a counterfeit. Idols pull us from truth and life which is deception and death.\n\nA- The way to life is not by avoiding lies and death but pursuing Christ. As I pursue Christ, I pursue truth and with youth, life.\n\nP- God I need you to work in my heart. To purge and rip out all that is not of you. Help me to keep myself from all idols that pull at my heart.\n\nOct 30\n\nS- Look so yourselves that we do not lose those things we worked for, but that we may receive a full reward. 2 John\n\nO- We can receive a full reward, or we can lose the things we have worked for. Some the strongest and Solomon the wisest and David the bravest (closest to God) also lost by lust.\n\nHow did Joseph do it?\n\nA- Who has the key to integrity in the Bible?\n\n[in prison? no freedom? Close to Jesus?]\n\nP- God please help me in my integrity and living a life of no compromise.\n\nPastor Billy Lile - Spiritual Family-mich, nadson, Arkenna\n\nSpiritual Family heals natural family - Unless a man leaves they cannot be my disciple.\n\nEph 2:14-22 - No longer strangers, but citizens \u0026 members of his household.\n\nCitizens AND family\n\nSpiritual Family - God's design for his people.\n\n\u0026 Club \u0026 change/conflict\n\n\u0026 Friend \u0026 change \u0026 choose\n\n\u0026 natural family \u0026 purpose\n\nNeed to be intentional w/ all relationships.\n\n1. Cultivate Relationships (Daily Care) eg Water, Birth young, create Fun moments\n\n2. Cheer/Celebrate one another\n\n3. Pray w/ one another - Prayer = Passion=\n\nSpiritual Family fuels healthy \u0026 sustain ministry",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213344699.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213344699.jpeg"
