          "journal_date": "2025-02-21",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 21\n\nS-Paul an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God to the saints who are in ephesus, and faithful in Christ Jesus. Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. Eph 1:1,2\n\nO - He identifies who he is, the authority by which he comes, his mission and who his audience is and what his message is.\n\n1. Man - Paul        Man - Paul        Paul-Christ\n2. Mandate/Mission    Mandate-Authority-Under God        Mandate - Authority - Saints scattered\n3. Market            Market - Audience - Saints scattered\n4. Message            Message - Grace\n\nA - I'll do all my intros with this format.\n\nMessenger/ - Jonevan\nMission - Help Rams guys to succeed in life\nMandate - God's Word.\nMarket - Rams quarters\nMessage - Steward your time/talent/treasure well\n\nP - God please help me to be a blessing tonight.\n\nIntro - Jonevan Pastor - 3rd generation local. Make a teachers salary. Never made more than a teachers salary.\nGrandparents - Restaurant owners, real estate, Gas stations, Auto Parts \u0026 Stock market. Dad Jslani aged \u003e Full time ministry.\n• Desire for ministry - marketplace. Dad - Bivocational Rule of 72%. Not been much you make but what you do with what you make. Benn doubled so is more than a million dollars. 2 million\n\nNot how much you have. But what you do with what you have.\n\nLikes not Laxer - Deal with it. - Multiply what you get.\n\nGod expects us to increase what he's given.\n\n• Obstacles\n  • Fear that God was harsh - know God will meet your need.\n  • In Comparison of wealthy - Don't judge others.\n  • Protecting from loss is good enough. - Stewardship bless others\n  • Know God is for you. Expect him to bless you. - Jesus\n  • Don't compare \u0026 Judg. Steward's celebrate\n  • Not losing isn't winning. Invest.\n  • Starting amount is not what we are judged on, it's what we do with it and how we steward it.\n\nWhat do we stewarded - Time talent treasure\n\nTime/Attention - Talent - Treasure\n\nMake Money\n\nManage - Budgeting\n\nMobilizing - Investing\n\nMultiplying - Scaling",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212503678.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212503678.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Ephesians 1:1-2",
          "source": "imported",
