          "ocr_text": "Feb 17\nunrighteous\nS- And with all tying exception among those who perish because\nthey did not receive the love of the truth that they\nmight be saved. And for this reason God will send\nthem strong delusion that they should believe a\nlie, that they all may be condemned who did not\nbelieve the truth but had pleasure in unrighteousness. II\nThess 2:10-12\n\nO- When we don't love death we open ourselves up to\ndeception. Even strong delusion from God. We need\nto love the truth.\n\nA- I need to be transparent and truthful\nabout everything in my life. Strength and weaknesses\n\nP- God help me to love truth. You are the way\ntruth and life.\n\nFeb 18\n\nS- For even when we were with you we commanded you this\nthat anyone will not work, neither shall he eat. 2 Thes 3:10\n\nO- The counsel of Paul was that people needed to work\nfor their God. The county of Polk needs to find a\nsolution for homelessness.\n\nA- What are the most successful solutions out there?\nI'll look up things on AI.\n\nP- God help me to help the helpless. But to\nadminister Justice as well.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212518196.jpeg",
