          "journal_date": "2025-02-28",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 28\nS- Children obey your parents in the Lord. For THIS is right. Honor your father and your mother which is the first commandment with promise, that it may be well with you and you may live long on the earth. Fathers do not provoke your children to wrath but ___. Eph6:1, 2\nO- Honor is Right even when parents are not.\nA- We can apply the same principle of value based honor is merit based honor as forgiveness. Owed and not earned.\nP- God, help me to honor authority be cause it is right, not because they are right. Help me to model honor as best as I can.\n\nMARCH 1\nS- PA Unless the Lord build the house, they labor in vain who build it. Unless the Lord guard the city the watchmen stay away in vain. Ps127\nO- Parenting is a partnership. God helps build our house as we labor. God guards as we watch.\nA- We must labor, and watch but partner with God to train our kids. I must be under authority and model honor.\nP- God, help me to always respect and honor my parents and be a better son.\n\nMarch 2\nS- Like drawing in the hand of a warrior so are the children of ones youths. Happy is the man who quiver full of them. They shall not be ashamed but speak to the enemies in the gate. Ps 121\nO- for children to reach their destiny, they must be released. This is one thing that needs to be straightened and filed and perfected to fly straight. Created to leave the quiver.\nA- I need to spend more time straightening my children. How?\nP- God, please give us grace and wisdom to spend more time w/ each other and less time on electronics.\n\nMarch 3\nS- Since you have purified your souls in obeying the truth through the spirit in sincere love of the brethren, love one another fervently with a pure heart, having been again, not of corruptible seed, but incorruptible through the Word of God which lives and abides forever.1Peter3\nO- Love is motivation. Spirit is power. Obedience is action. Purity is result.\nA- I must love others through God's spirit, by obeying truth and be purified.\nP- Help me to love others. Amen.\n\nMarch 4\nS- Honor all people. Love the brotherhood. Fear God. Honor the King. 1 Pet 2:17\nO- Honor is owed to all, \u0026 the King. Love toward spiritual family. Fear only God.\nA- Easy to mix these up, but Love, Fear, \u0026 Honor the right things\nP- God, help me to fear you above all things.",
