          "journal_date": "2025-12-12",
          "ocr_text": "Dec 12\nS- Little children keep yourselves from idols. I John 5:21\n\nO- Not having any idols in the OT, I second command and the people didn't get it all. I have a\nanother as We loved me.\n\nA- First to love is a verb. Not an emotion. Love one another and specifically give to God\nthose who cry out for need.\n\nP- God help me to follow you to love Virginia and have all in my heart as well be a calling\nso let me generous with the blessing you give to me.\n\nDec 13\nS- No Flesh from Adam prophesied about these men also saying Jubel be the Lord commanded\nhis saints to execute judgment on all to dds of who are saved to answer to him, which they\nhave committed in an ungodly ungodly deeds and hard things spoken against Him. Jude 1:14-16\n\nO- Interesting that Jude speaks from Adam and Enoch spoken against Him in scripture.\n\nA- I'd like to read Enoch and see what Jude was not licensed by Enoch's writing Jude was\nP- God help me not to be deceived.\n\nDec 14\nS- Behold a virgin will be with child and bear a son and they shall call his name Emmanuel\nwhich is translated God with us. Isaiah 7:14; Matt 1:23\n\nO- Jesus was God walking with us and showing how to love. How to love. How he taught. He healed. He lived with God and with\n\nA- I want to live like Jesus. Study more. Teach more.\n\nP- Jesus I'm so far from who I should be. I have thrown out so much. Love blessed\nso much. I have thrown up all of me keeps so much. So much. I need help me\nbalance my life after, so much. Help me\n\nDec 15\nO- This I this was doing that it might be called dishes was spoken by the Lord through the prophet. Matt 1:22\n\nO- And I don't do any thing without first speaking through the prophet.\n\nA- These prophets 'voices that are speaking through and to the body of Christ. I need\nto hear easy vessel to that God is saying into me.\n\nP- God please help me to hear what you are saying and to live what you speak to me\n\nDec 16\nS- When he heard the king heard this he was troubled and all Jersalem\nwith him. And when he had gathered all the chief priests and scribes of the people\ntogether he inquired of them where the Christ was to be born. Matt 2:3,4\n\nO- There were people who studied and believed the word and he knew it was\nyet they didn't report. All of Jerusalem worried about this and was headed.\n\nA- When God does something significant, it troubles everyone even though He comes in peace.\n\nP- God help me to live when you do but only what you do but with what heart you do it with.\n\nDec 17\nS- Those who received the 5 talents went and traded with them and gained 5 more.\nTherefore take the talent from him and give it to him who has ten talents. For everyone has\nmore will be given and he will have abundance. But whoever does not have even what he has will\nbe taken away. Matt 25:16-29\n\nO- One was traded lost what they had. Every loss informs fables us to gain more. God will bless those who\ntake risks.\n\nA- I need to do careful inventory of what I have and begin to trade in what I have and\nhave. I have time. I have talents. I need to multiply what I have. I need to have\nthe process. I need peace [real] trust. You for give me the time and use in my\nprocess. I need your hand to work against a wall and use a miracle in my\nlife.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
