          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-24",
          "ocr_text": "Feb 24\nS- That Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith, that you being rooted and grounded in love, may be able to comprehend with all the saints what is the width and length and depth and height, to know the love of Christ which passes knowledge that you may be filled with all the fullness of God. Eph 3:5\n\nO- I need to allow Christ to dwell in me so that Eph 3:5 I'm rooted \u0026 grounded in love. Fullness of God is a product of understanding the love of Christ.\n\nA- Understanding Jesus love for me will unlock everything. Roots bring fruits. Root of love brings fruits of Christ.\n\nP- God please help me to love you with all my heart and love others in the same way you love me.\n\nFeb 25\nS- let him who stole steal no more but let him work with his hands what is good that he may have something to give him who has need. Eph 4:28\n\nO- Work with your hand what is good to be able to be generous to others in need.\n\nA- I am going into a hole SK a month. I need to create a business that generates that type of income.\n\nP- Lord help me increase my faith to believe I can make this income and help many people be profitable in markets and in crypto.\n\nFeb 26\nS- For this you know, that we cannot, unclean person or covetous man who is an idolater has any inheritance in the kingdom of God Christ and God. Eph 5:5\n\nO- This lists everything I clear I am. I need a saviour. I\n\nA- I need to live a life of honesty, integrity, discipline, honor, righteousness.\n\nP- God please help me to be like Joseph and Jesus. Give me grace. Grace to obey. Grace to love. To sacrifice.\n\nFeb 27\nS- Proverbs 27:16 Where there is no vision the people cast off restraint, but happy is he who keeps the law (Acts 26:22). And now behold I am going to Jerusalem constrained by the Spirit, not knowing what will happen to me there. John 21:18 When you were young you used to dress yourself and walk where you wanted, but when you are old you will stretch out your hands, and another will dress you and carry you where you do not want to go. This he said to show by what kind of death he was to glorify God. And after saying this he said to him, \"Follow me\".\n\nO- The more we grow, the more responsibility God gives to us. The result of success is more stewardship. Stewardship limits options, focuses energy, increases impact.\n\nA- The stewardship of everything in life is the call. Myself, my wife, my kids, my health, my wealth, my positions \u0026 influence. All is stewardship.\n\nP- God, please help me to serve you in the best way possible.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
