          "journal_date": "2025-10-02",
          "ocr_text": "Sept 30\nS - But the rest of mankind who were not killed by these plagues did not repent of the work of their hands that they should not worship demons and idols of gold silver brass stone wood which can neither see nor hear nor walk. And they did not repent of their murder sorceries or their sexual immorality or their thefts. Rev\n\nO - Wickedness, hardness of heart, heart like flint is caused by pride. Similar to the 16 plagues of Egypt. Wickedness doesn't compromise or relent.\n\nA - Don't try to understand, compromise or make peace with evil. Evil doesn't change, soften, reason or compromise. Just live in a way that pleases God.\n\nP - God help me to live wise as serpents \u0026 harmless as doves. Devoted to you and no one else.\n\nO - Then when I took the little book out of the angel hand and ate it and it was sweet as honey in my mouth but when I had eaten it my stomach became bitter. Rev 10:10\n\nO - There is a time for prophecy to be understood. The end time prophecy is immediately awesome to understand but painful in fulfillment\n\nA - I must be mentally and spiritually prepared for suffering. The prophetic is never welcomed by the world.\n\nP - God help me to be faithful to the prophetic insight you give to me. Help me not to remain silent but to speak the things you have stolen to me.\n\nOct\nAugust 2\nS - But if anyone wants to harm them, fire pours out from their mouths and devours their enemies. And if anyone wants to harm them, he must be killed in this manner. These have power to shut heaven so that no rain falls in the days of their prophecy and they have power over water to turn them to blood and to strike the earth with all plagues as often as they desire. Revelation\n\nO - There will be two prophets protected by God that will speak God's word and each with signs. Water/Earth/Heaven\n\nA - True prophets have protection and power from God. They anger and torment God's enemies. They get killed\n\nP - God help me to be discerning of what you want me to speak\n\nOct\nAugust 8 Waipuna Chapel\n\u0026 Fires of Revival\n\nIntro - Encouragement -\n• Love Shawn \u0026 Jess - Apostolic/Dynamis U2 concert\n• Pastor to me.\n• Waipuna - Witness in: Land, Upcountry, Fires, Kids Hope Preschool, Mokwena Campus, Monthly Baptisms\n  Doubling in size.\n• Pain precedes Birth - (Natural \u0026 Spiritual)\n• Pain increases capacity to love - Brenna Brown\n  • Mothers love better\n  • Wyatt\n  • Leaders travail\n  • Widow + Lahaina Fire\n  • Jesus\n  • Pain",
