          "ocr_text": "Nov 1\nS- Pray that you may prosper in all things and be in health, just as your soul prospers. III John 1/2\nO- God's desire is that our soul (mind will emotions) are in health, and that we also prosper in all things.\nA- Prosperity is nothing if my soul is not prospering. I need to prioritize the health of my soul.\nP- God please help my soul to prosper. Help me to prioritize prosperity and love myself the way you love me.\n\nNov 1\nS- Guard your heart with all diligence for out of it will flow every issue of life. Prov 4:23\nO- My heart controls my desires. What I put into my heart controls my desires. Eve saw the fruit. Samson spent time w/ Delilah. She pleased him. David saw Bathsheba from his roof top. They saw. The desired. Their hearts corrupted. David prayed for a pure heart and united desires.\nA- Integrity= Integer = consistent. One heart. One desire. One focus. I must guard \u0026 protect my heart\nP- God please help me to have a united heart to fear your name.\n\nNov 2\nS- Matthew 6:21 For where so will your heart be your treasure is\nO- My treasure is my time talent money. I choose where to invest them. My heart takes me to the destination on the map.\nA- I need to load the destination by investing my time talent and treasure in the place I want to go.\nP- God give me grace to go in the right direction and to have the foresight to see the bad place lust is taking me.\n\nNov 3 Set your affection on things above not on things of this earth. Col 3:2\nO- I can SET my affection on the right things. I don't need to be led by my flesh and desires of my self.\nA- I need to SET my affection. INVEST my heart in the right things.\nP- God help me to put rails. Boundaries around my heart and life to do the right thing.\n\nTaylor Daniel Stevens - EN Updates\nRomans 15:2 Many names recognized prioritize relationships.\nClusters are an investment\n1. Reconnect Relationally\n2. Refresh our Faith\n3. Refocus on mission\n   vision tests\n\nOversight                    7membership Standards?\nPastor\nApostolic   Global Team\nCouncil\n            Regional\n\nPhil Danese -\nGerry said yes and God placed His heart for GBC into his heart.\nSo many say no and give their hearts to other things.\nGod is asking who will go? His eyes roam looking for someone\nto show strong on His behalf. I need to say yes globally\nsaid Gerry said locally.\n\nSeth Trimmer - Finishing Strong\nIs it happens to them, when to me?\nGive up vs Try harder = End is near.\nSomething broken, Jesus can fix it.\nDiscipline enforces the heart. Good or Bad\nMatt 19:14 Parable of treasure. Way to sell everything.\nKingdom is worth EVERYTHING. Desire/Attraction/Love.\nWhat you love, you will sacrifice EVERYTHING for, and not vice\n\nSell everything for Jesus vs Sell Jesus for everything.\nJesus and Mary vs Jesus and Judas\nJesus is the Reward. Doing things 4 Jesus vs dwelling\n\nKingdom is treasure in the field to sell everything for\nto extract value from.\n- Bernard of Clairvaux 4 stages\n1. Love self for self. Wanting to feel good about yourself\n2. Love God for self. Use God for me.\n3. Love God for God - Unconditional love.\n4. Love self for Gods Sake - Loving everything and everyone with\nthe same love that God has, including ourselves.\nThis is NOT Self Esteem and Self love.\n\nStaying in the game is growing in Gods LOVE.\n\nSymptoms of NOT Growing\nPetition vs Adoration\nJoyful disappointment vs Devastated (Emotions indicate things\nare out of place)\nFatigue vs Burnout - Larry Crabb\n\nWhen I am in pain, 'How do I find God here?'\n\nBeginning Test: Test of Self Centeredness\nFinish Test: Test of Justified self centeredness.",
