          "ocr_text": "Sidney\n\nFear - All\nFailure - All\nFaith - Some\nSuccess - Less\n\nHow to Start\n1. Do what you love\n2. Differentiate from competitors\n3. Study - Sector - Book keeping\n4. Get Mentor \u0026 Read books\n\nFeb 23\nJ- And with all unrighteousness deception among those who perish because they did not receive the love of the truth, that they might be saved. II Thess 2:10\n\nO - Don't even need to reject truth, we just used to not LOVE TRUTH. We need to RECEIVE the LOVE TRUTH.\n\nA - I need to receive a LOVE of TRUTH. David loved the WORD because he read it. As we read it, we begin to love it.\n\nP - God, help me to plunge on your word to love your word.\n\nDavid Ward                Resources StudyRight.org\nThoughts:                    Bible Hub\n1. Fathers Eyes              How to read the Bible for all its worth\n2. No condemnation                          Douglas\n3. Love keeps no record of wrong          Stuart\n4. God is love\n5. Matt 6 - What you haven't done he wont remember\n   What you have done he wont forget\n6. What you attach neg emotion yoall avoid.\n\nFast Hole of Community with work in between.\n\nIllustrations\nWord Picture - crushed olives\nUse elsewhere -\nRe-enact metaphor - so they can feel it\nReserved metaphor - use that metaphore in modern days\nForce metaphore\nVinettes - Pieces of a story - Theytell not - 3 stories weavd together - hit many stages of life\nParables - Recognize stories in life\nOthers Story\nScenes - Movies\nQuotes\n\nHonor your Father\nWeight of Glory - Meaning a Feeling\n                 Respect  Weight\n                          Heavy\nTo Make Heavy, Honor = Reward\n\nSERMON  ARTISTRY\nExperience across time - Form 2 Flow\n        100%\n        Aspect                    Text  Yeah!\n        of the\n        Exposition                Analyzing\nAmbiguity          Distortion\n                   Tension\n                   Light\n\n       Lower\n       LOOP                        give salt before H2O\n\n