          "ocr_text": "December 25-26 Goals/Foresight\nNov 24\nS-Grace and peace be multiplied to you in the knowledge of God and\nSavior Jesus Christ. Grace and peace as the divine knowledge of God and\nto us all things that pertain to life and godliness through the knowledge\nof Him, Jesus Christ called us to His glory and virtue. 2 Pet 1:2,3\nO-We have been called to know Jesus glory and virtue. The grace and peace\ncan be multiplied to us through Jesus. Ref 1:3,2\nA-Spending time reading, writing and meditating on His word\nwill give me grace and peace.\nP-God give us grace and peace multiplied through\nunderstanding you in a deeper way.\n\nNov 25\nS-By which He has given to us exceedingly great and precious promises\nthat through these you may be partakers of the divine nature,\nhaving escaped the corruption that is in the world through lust.\n1 Pet. 1:4\nO-God gives us the ability to escape the lust of the world\nthrough His divine power. Through knowledge of Him, there\nis corruption that happens through lust of the\nflesh. I must give myself more called to the promised.\nA-I have access to experience a divine nature that escapes\nall corruption through knowledge of Jesus.\nGrace and peace can be multiplied to me through Him.\nP-God thank you for your exceeding and great promises that\nyou have already given to me. Help me to live in\nit fully.\n\nNov 26\nS-Best for this very reason, giving all diligence, add to your faith\nvirtue, virtue knowledge, to knowledge self control, to self\ncontrol perseverance, to perseverance godliness, brotherly\nkindness, and to brotherly kindness love. 1 Pet 1:5,6,7.\nO-The end of everything is love. Starts with diligence,\nthen virtue then knowledge then self control.\nA-I need to understand the progression of this and\nmemorize it and give thought to memorize it.\nP-God help me to love the brethren.",
