          "ocr_text": "March 5\n\nS- Finally all of you be of one mind having compassion for one another, love as brothers, be tenderhearted, be cautious not returning evil or reviling for reviling but on the contrary blessing, knowing that you were called to this that you may inherit a blessing. 1 Pet 3:8,9\n\nO- When we live, compassion, Forgive, we position ourself to get a blessing from the Lord.\n\nA- I didn't know there was a promise of inheritance in living a life of compassion, forgiveness and love. More instruction to live like Jesus.\n\nP- Lord thank you for loving me and promising a blessing to me to love like you. Being like you is a reward in itself but awesome to have an additional promise of inheritance.\n\nMarch 6\n\nLove God through loving his word.\n\nBible isn't work. It's our love.\nWhat will be MY call from the LORD? \"I stand before God, for you\"\n\nThe scriptures are a place to sit and hear, Not just a tool to use.\n\nPain Points\n• Series \u0026 Sermon Planning.\n• Prepping 3 weeks in advance.\n• Hard to form Habits.\n• Heredity vs Artistry\n\nTeaching Team\nFORMATION\n\nNeed community for formation\n\nSTEPS to Big Picture\n(1) Micro → Macro detailed observation. 2x- Do this 2x per sermon only. 15 min to prepare. 2x with others.\n(2) Catalyst \u0026 (Community) = Discipline\n1. Catalyst makes faster \u0026 lengthens RW.\n1. The preaching life: Preaching makes me a better person.\n\nArcheology produces Artistry.\n\nStudy each book in detailed observation.\n2x detailed observation. 1x circle, 2x underline, 3x Strike through.\n\nCOMMUNITY = DISCIPLINE\n\nPut Detailed Observation in the meeting.\n\nMicro → Macro\nCatalyst → Community\n\nThings to Observe\n• Subject, Object, Verb\n• Propositions\n• Conjunctions\n\nTone of Scripture → Translate → Tone of Life\nEx Example: Gal - you abolish Galations who has bewitched you Foolish → Tone of Father → Stupid kids. Illustration → I did this dumb. My father scolded me.\n\nThemes - Neh 4 - Sarcalast, Opposition, mockery\n\nIntroduction - Disclose/Withheld - They mocked - We built",
