          "journal_date": "2025-03-07",
          "ocr_text": "March 7\nS- Only Noah and those who were with him in the ark remained alive. And the waters prevailed on the earth for 150 days. Gen 7:23,24\nO- Baptism symbolized the flood where evil was destroyed and those of faith were saved. The cross is the ark that saves from death but the ark needed to be built and entered into. Action can create a shelter when it is done in faith and obedience.\nA- Because there is a storm coming, the boat of faith in action must be made. Faith is visible. It looks crazy. I foresees future events and takes action for the benefit of others.\nP- God help me to consider your opinion over all others. Help me to love god obey you whole heartedly.\n\nMarch 8\nC- While the earth remains, seedtime and harvest, cold and heat, winter and summer and day and night shall not cease. Gen 8:22\nO- No matter how good things can get, prepare for ugly times. No matter how ugly things are prepare for better times.\nA- God please give me eyes to see into the future and to plan accordingly. Help me to see your hand in my life and lean hard into what you have for me.\nP- Lord I surrender to you. Help me to sow seeds that will grow in your time. And harvest fruit when summer ends.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212629066.jpeg",
