          "journal_date": "2025-03-26",
          "ocr_text": "March 26 11:50am\nS- The next day a great multitude that had come to the feast when they heard Jesus was coming took palm branches and went out to meet him and cried out, \"Hosanna! Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord! The king of Israel.\"\nO- correct- Jesus is coming, he is coming in the name of the lord.\nIncorrect- Feast of Tabernacles during Passover. Right person/wrong time.\nThese people came but their heart was in the wrong spot. They were attracted to power.\nA- I should evaluate my heart. Why do I serve Jesus?\nP- God, I'm sorry for being selfish and serving for my own reasons.\n\nMarch 27 11:50\nS- Why was this fragrant oil not sold for 300 denarii? and given to the poor? John 12:5\nO- Judas was criticizing someone else's gift instead of focusing on his own. When someone is a thief, when they are not giving, they will criticize others who give or will judge. Michael \u0026 David, Cain \u0026 Abel, Mary and Judas Lucifer, Daniel \u0026 kings advisors, Esther \u0026 Haman. It's a thirst for worship.\nA- I don't want to thirst for wealth, worship. I want to be a servant. Many view themselves as servants but don't give. I didn't ever want to criticize someone else's worship.\nP- God please help me to worship you with my heart soul mind \u0026 strength\n\nMarch 28 12:05\nS- This he said not because he cared for the poor but because he was a thief and he used to take what was put in it. John 12:6\nO- Jesus knew Judas was a thief and still allowed him to handle the money box. God may call sin and put the tree in the middle of the garden. He allowed sad to slaughter the priests. Aloud Pharaoh to go back on his word.\nA- God's permission doesn't equate to His approval. 1:20pm\nP- God you are Patient. Help me to use your trust permission and patience to repent.\n\nMarch 29\nS- But Jesus said 'Let her alone, that she may keep this for the day of my burial. For the poor you have with you always but me you do not always have John 12:7,8\nO- God gave freedom to Judas to make it his choice and also gave freedom to the woman to make her choice to worship. Israel was to go to the wilderness to worship. Cain stopped Abel from worship. Choosing the tree of life is worship. It's taking from one tree and giving to another.\nA- God help me to put you first in my time talent \u0026 treasure\nP- Lord help me to worship you with all of my heart soul mind \u0026 strength",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
