          "ocr_text": "March 23\n\nS- And the came out from the burnt offering and the fat\non the altar, when all the people saw it they shouted\nand fell in their faces... So fire went out from the Lord\nand devoured them and they died before the Lord. Lev 10:3\n\nO- After an amazing display of God's power, the priest fell\nwith presumption and they died. This happened with Peter\ntoo when he said Jesus was God's son. This happened after\nNoah's sale family. He should be careful when we study\ntext to call.\n\nA- Good to walk before God will greater reverence and\nholiness. A greater honor and respect for who He\nis.\n\nP- God, help me to walk before you with holiness\nin integrity and honor. Please forgive me for not\nhonoring you with everything.\n\nQuestions\nWhy did Elisha ask what you have instead of fundraise for\nher? The husband feared God but lived in debt. He didn't leave\nhis affairs in order. She was going to lose her sons on top\nof losing her husband. She could have been bitter against\nher husband but honored his memory. She knew he feared\nGod more than the debt he left. She went to her husband\nmentors Elijah. Why did Elisha ask what he could do? Then\nask what she had? He points her to what she has, then\nsets the stage for he to act in faith. I'm going to\nmultiply what you have but you need to prepare.\nWhy were they instructed to close the door?",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212653198.jpeg",
