          "ocr_text": "March 18\nS- Faith is the substance of things hoped for\n   the evidence of things not seen Heb 11:1\nO- Faith has substance and is evidence of the invisible\n   hopes of the believer\n   Hope and evidence are real things that are\n   based in future reality. Living by faith or in\n   faith allows me to see and be what God\n   wants me to be.\nP- God help me to have faith in you and the\n   promises of my life.\n\nMarch 19.\nS- By faith we understand that the worlds were\n   framed by the word of God so that the things\n   which are seen are of made of things which do\n   appear or are visible. Heb 11:3\nO- By faith we understand that our world was made\n   by His Word. \u0026 The visible was made by\n   the invisible.\nA- I must step out in faith when God speaks\n   something into my heart of the future and\n   act.\nP- God please help me to have faith in all\n   you have for me.\n\nMarch 20\nS- By faith Abel offered to God a more excellent sacrifice than\n   Cain through which he obtained a witness that he was\n   righteous, God testifying of his gifts and through it, he being\n   dead still speaks- Heb 11:4\nO- How does a dead still speak? God told Cain your\n   brothers blood calls out to me from the ground. Her\n   righteousness from the sacrifice spoke to God\n   after he died and continues to speak till this\n   day.\nA- Our sacrifice has a voice. It has a legacy that\n   is NEVER SILENCED. The woman that gave all\n   was recorded and continues to speak about her\n   till this day. When we sacrifice for the\n   Lord, it is something that is NEVER FORGOTTEN.\nP- God, help me to have eternal eyes that seek\n   to give you what is worthy of you.\n\nMarch 21\nS- For by it the elder obtained a good testimony. Heb 11:2\nO- Faith is something that allows someone to be spoken\n   of well by God and heaven.\nA- God if I act in FAITH, then God will speak of\n   me well. It will allow me to do what is pleasing\n   in Gods sight.\nP- Lord please help me to live a life that is\n   honoring and pleasing to you. Help me to love\n   my children and my wife more.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212663376.jpeg",
