          "journal_date": "2025-04-07",
          "ocr_text": "April 7\nS- And they answered and said to Him, Where Lord? So He said to them, Wherever the body is there the eagles will be gathered. Luke 17:37\nO- The place where the body is being taken to is not the rapture but to the valley of nights.\nA- The judgement will happen to people who other people don't suspect. S Psalm Suisse. Judas many, friends. But judgement comes for everyone.\nP- God help me to be prepared for your return.\n\nApril 8\nS- If a brother or sister is naked and destitute of daily food and one of you says to them Depart in peace be warm and filled but you do not give them the things which are needed for the body what does it profit? James 2:15,16\nO- We need our actions to match our words. We need to God the hungry and clothe the naked and show Gods love in a practical way to others.\nA- The interest of idle money should go to those who need it. I need to send out emails to God what the need is.\nP- God please help us to be a blessing to our community.\n\nApril 9\nS- I have trodden the wine press alone and from the people no one was with me. I have 4 idden them in my anger and trampled them in my fury. Their blood is sprinkled upon my garments and have stained my robes. For the day of vengeance is in my heart and the year of my redeemed has come. Isaiah 63:3,4\n\nO- Jesus is trampling out the winepress of his enemies where their blood is splattering on his robes. Same as Revelation Mt. Rev 19 has imagery of Isaiah 63, Matt 24, Luke 17.\nA- I will live in the appeal of God and live for His appeal and not the world or myself.\nD- God help me to understand the balance of grace and truth and live in their effects.\n\nApril 10\nS- And they answered and said to him Where Lord? So he said to them, Wherever the bodies are the eagles will be gathered. Luke 17:37, Matt 24\nO- The eagles gathering is a place where Jesus comes back to judge the wicked. I need to understand the severity of the judgement of God but the love and grace of God as well.\nA- I must meditate on the truth \u0026 justice of God. He revealed in the OT, the NT and Revelation.\nP- God help me to understand the extremes of your grace and your truth. Help me to walk in fear of you.\n\nApril 11th\nS- And because lawlessness will abound, the love of many will grow cold. But he also endures to the end shall be saved. Matt 24:12\nO- Living outside the law = loveless. This you will know who loves me, they shall keep my commandments.\nA- I am not under the law but under grace. I am a bond servant set free to return out of love not obligation.\nP- God help me to understand your love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212675975.jpeg",
