          "journal_date": "2025-04-03",
          "ocr_text": "April 3\nS - Now I saw heaven opened and behold a white horse. And He who is Faithful eat on him was called Faithful and True, and in righteousness He judges and makes War. Rev11:11\nO - John saw a revealer of Jesus Christ. No longer on a donkey but on a horse. He was a judge ready for wars\nA - I need to see this side of Christ in my life. He was on a donkey, but He is in heaven on a horse. Ready to come back to earth to judge and make war.\nP - God please forgive me for my sins. Help me to not look at grace as an excuse to sin. You are patient and longsuffering.\n\nApril 4\nS - His eyes were like a flame of fire and on his head were many crowns. He had a name written that no one knew except Himself. He was clothed with a robe dipped in blood and His name is called the Word of God. Rev 19;12,13\nO - This is a picture much different than Jesus on a donkey. This is a Jesus who has finished His assignment of being the humble servant riding on a donkey who gave His life as a sacrifice for sin. This is a king getting ready for war.\nA - I need to see Jesus like this. One who has all authority. One who I give my full allegiance to.\nP - God help me to serve you with my whole heart and to serve you as my king.\n\nApril 5\nS - Now out of His mouth goes a sharp sword that with it He should strike the nations. And He Himself will rule them with an iron rod. Himself and the winepress of the fierceness and wrath of Almighty God. Rev 19;\nO - The grapes of wrath are tread out by Jesus. This imagery takes you to Isaiah 63:3-4. Jesus trodden the wicked and their blood was splattered on his garments. For the day of vengeance was in my heart and the year of My redemption had come.\nA - So I want to take the opportunity to repent and be on the right side when Jesus comes back.\nP - Lord help me to repent and to worship you with everything that I have.\n\nApril 6:\nS - Then I saw an angel standing in the sun and he cried with a loud voice saying to all the birds that fly in the midst of heaven. \"come gather together for the supper of God\" that you may eat the flesh of captains the flesh of mighty men, the flesh of horses and of those who sit on them and the flesh of all people, free and slave, both small and great.\nRev 19:19\nO - Supper of God - Birds eating everyone who is against Jesus. The birds were gorged w/ their flesh.\nA - I will walk with a fear and awe for Jesus. I don't want to be counted as His enemy.\nP - God help me to wear the wedding clothes that is worthy of the celebration of the marriage of the LAMB.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212690167.jpeg",
