          "journal_date": "2025-03-30",
          "ocr_text": "March 30    135 pm\n\nS - Now a great many of the Jews knew He was there and they came not for Jesus sake only but that they might also see Lazarus whom he raised from the dead. John 12:9\n\nO - I would if it was the same crowd that yelled to crucify Jesus. OT said it was not. Crowd dynamics are interesting. Jesus didn't rally his base with a clear mission. Pharisees worked through the crowd to sway authority. Jesus base had no leadership.\n\nA - Crowds follow leaders. Money can be used to sway crowds \u0026 crowd to sway government.\n\nP - God help me to serve you and never the crowd.\n\nMarch 31\n\nS - For this reason the people also incl Him because they had heard he had done this sign. John 12:1\n\nO - People seek signs but God is looking for true worshippers.\n\nA - Resurrection is the only sign that Jesus said those wanting a sign would get\n\nP - God please help me to live my life to worship you. To give you my first responsibility to worship you with your heart soul mind and my strength. 150\n\n1:50\n\nApril 1\n\nS - Fear not daughter of Zion behold your king is coming Sitting on a donkey: ass. Q - Donkeys had a symbol of Peace. Solomon \u0026 david both rode donkeys but donkeys had a connotation of peace and prosperity.\n\nA - Jesus riding on a colt symbolized he had come first for peace. Not to take over. He will do that later.\n\nP - Lord help me to understand the signs of the time. And to have a heart of its servant.\n\nApril 2\n\nS - But the chief priests plotted to put Lazarus to death also because on account of him many of the Jews went away and believed in Jesus. John 12: 10-11\n\nO - The tool that Satan has against worship is murder. And God will allow it to happen until the return of Christ. Blessed in the door his sight are the death of His saints.\n\nA - When Jesus returns there will be vengeance against the evildoers of the world. He will establish his kingdom through the sword.\n\nP - God help me to be on the right side when you return",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212705100.jpeg",
