        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T00:52:05.733277+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "id": "5d2616dc-bbfb-4e82-be03-6c8fb21fb640",
          "import_batch_id": "3ee87fcd-f0ef-4152-94b0-d584085b4ee6",
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2025-04-22",
          "ocr_text": "April 22\nS- And he will send Jesus who was preached to you before, when heaven must receive until the time of restoration of all things which God has spoken from the mouth of all his holy prophets since the world began. Acts 3:20-21\nO- Jesus went up but he will return and his return is soon. We should be prepared.\nA- I should read and meditate on the Word to be prepared at what is to come.\nP- God help me to understand and to prepare my heart and be for your return.\n\nApril 23\nS- And it shall be that every soul that shall not hear that Prophet shall be utterly destroyed from among the people. Acts 3:23\nO- Jesus warns of judgement many times because it is something that is coming. Save from corruption. Saved from wrath to come. Saved to love God \u0026 others.\nA- I will read to remind myself of what I need to be saved from and saved to.\nP- God help me to have the love for you that will keep me from sin.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212718317.jpeg",
