alty of his people and the place where his call from the is the place Where his people in spite of their ungodly hearts. It loves me and is for me.\n\nA- I can come boldly asking Jesus to change my heart.\n\nP- God please give me a soft heart to love, allow and obey you with all my heart.\n\nDec 21\nS- Return O backsliding children says the Lord for I am married to you. I will take you, One from a city and two from a family and I will bring you to Zion. Jer 3:14\n\nO- God already Behold says He is married to us. He loves us and wants me to return to Him.\n\nA- I need to stop hoping God will love me and believe that he already does.\n\nP- God thank you for giving me a love that is greater than a sponge to me to be a good spouse to you and be faithful from my heart.",
