          "ocr_text": "Dec 23\nS- And He will reign over the house of Jacob forever and there will be no end. Luke 1:33\n\nO- Jesus brings Himself to be known as a Savior and King to all the earth. He will rule and will reign forever.\n\nA- Jesus is concerned w/ earth. He wants us to go to heaven. We want to go to Heaven, but Jesus longs to come to earth \u0026 rule forever here.\n\nP- God give me your heart and eyes.\n\nDec 24\nS- Through the exodus of our God w/th which the Passover God on high has sanctified us. To give to those who sit in darkness a light, it of death to guide our feet into the way of Peace. Luke 1:78-79\n\nO- He is redeemed King of Salem. Priest of the most High God. through sacrifice, way Jesus goes and again through sacrifice energies. We need priests a time of grace before the priests it's a sacrifice for His and whenever. We need the right rule and expectation. Time is the line of Peace. It's a time for us.\n\nA- I need the correct theology of this. Read it through pushback.\n\nP- God thank you for your hand on my life and the plans you have for me.\n\nDec 25\nS- Whoever has no rule over his own spirit is like a city broken down without walls. Prov. 25:28\n\nO- Discipline is a defense. The multifaceted life gives in to all kinds of our enemies. Our eating, not correcting us be disciples of it, not wasting addictions. Also, understand self discipline.\n\nA- I must be disciplined in every area of my life. It something Real like an accountable task.\n\nP- God please give me grace to be disciplined in every area.",
